2
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:48,700
高鳴る心臓に祈りを乗せて
Placing my prayers upon my pounding heart,

3
00:02:48,700 --> 00:02:51,500
曖昧な夢を描く
I paint an ambiguous dream.

4
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:54,200
幻想は想像のまま
Illusions won't just end

5
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:56,800
終われないんだ
in imagination alone.

6
00:03:01,300 --> 00:03:04,400
みんな今日はお披露目に来てくれてありがとう！
Everyone, thank you so much for coming to the reveal today!

7
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:09,900
答えを延々と探し続けて
Endlessly searching for answers,

8
00:03:09,900 --> 00:03:13,200
何者かになりたくて
wanting to become someone,

9
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:16,200
潸々と降る夕立ちを
I merely gazed out

10
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:18,500
ただ眺めた
at the pouring evening shower.

11
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:22,700
優しく寄り添って 心が晴れるのなら
If staying gently by your side can clear your heart,

12
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:26,900
翼が生えたような気がして
I feel as if I've sprouted wings;

13
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:31,900
いつだって隣にいるから
I'll always be right beside you.

14
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:37,700
だって言葉紡いで歌うことが わたしの運命だ
Because weaving words into song is my destiny.

15
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:44,200
世界にありふれた虚しささえも 上書きして
Overwriting even the hollow emptiness of this world,

16
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:49,000
路地裏に咲いた花のように 願いを照らす
illuminating wishes like a flower blooming in a back alley,

17
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:55,700
小さな光に憧れて
yearning for that tiny light.

18
00:04:06,900 --> 00:04:12,800
名前を持たない歌なんて 神様は認めてくれない
God won't acknowledge a song without a name.

19
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:17,600
一つ一つ枯れない花のように
Like flowers that never wither one by one,

20
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:23,600
昨日の自分にさよならして 零れた涙
saying goodbye to who I was yesterday, tears spill over;

21
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:29,300
上手く笑えなくてもいいかな
is it okay even if I can't smile properly?

22
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:34,900
だって理想は遠ざかってくばかり もう散々だよ
Because my ideals keep drifting away, it's just awful.

23
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:40,400
どれだけ手を伸ばして叫んだって 届かないの
No matter how far I reach and scream, it won't reach.

24
00:04:40,500 --> 00:04:46,400
望めばいつか叶うはずって 信じてる
I believe that if I wish, it will surely come true someday.

25
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:52,000
どうか歌よ響いて
Please, my song, resound!

26
00:04:54,800 --> 00:05:00,000
あぁ心臓の鼓動が今日も五月蝿い
Ah, the beating of my heart is so loud again today...

27
00:05:00,888 --> 00:05:05,588
行き止まりばっか 足が竦んで 立てないよ
Nothing but dead ends, my legs freeze up and I can't stand.

28
00:05:05,988 --> 00:05:11,588
音のない世界から 君を見つけて 連れ出すんだ
I'll find you in this soundless world and bring you out.

29
00:05:11,888 --> 00:05:17,088
言葉紡いで 歌うことが 私の運命だ
Spinning words and singing is my destiny.

30
00:05:17,388 --> 00:05:22,688
世界にありふれた 虚しささえも 上書きして
Overwriting even the emptiness that overflows in this world.

31
00:05:23,088 --> 00:05:28,088
路地裏に咲いた花のように 願いを照らす
Like a flower blooming in a back alley, illuminating wishes...

32
00:05:28,188 --> 00:05:33,688
小さな光に憧れて
longing for that tiny light.

33
00:05:37,388 --> 00:05:41,688
君の歌姫になれたら
If only I could become your diva...

34
00:05:42,088 --> 00:05:47,388
いいな
that would be wonderful.

35
00:06:12,888 --> 00:06:16,288
okey dokey 返事はいいけど
"Okey dokey"—an answer is fine, but...

36
00:06:16,388 --> 00:06:20,288
冗談なら笑えないよ
if it's a joke, I'm not laughing.

37
00:06:20,388 --> 00:06:23,888
渋滞 曖昧 どっちを向いちゃうの
Congested, ambiguous—which way are you looking?

38
00:06:23,988 --> 00:06:27,388
蜃気楼に手を伸ばした
I reached out to a mirage.

39
00:06:27,488 --> 00:06:31,188
微熱のような夢物語
A slight fever-like fairytale...

40
00:06:31,288 --> 00:06:35,388
そんな光は見ない振りしていた
I pretended not to see that kind of light.

41
00:06:35,488 --> 00:06:38,388
ざわめく鼓動 まだ行かないで
Restless heartbeat, don't leave just yet.

42
00:06:38,488 --> 00:06:41,488
幻じゃ嫌だよ
I don't want it to be an illusion.

43
00:06:41,588 --> 00:06:45,688
私を奪って 魅惑の dancing dancing night
Captivate me on this enchanting dancing, dancing night!

44
00:06:45,788 --> 00:06:49,188
拡がって収まんない universe
An expanding, boundless universe!

45
00:06:49,288 --> 00:06:53,188
君の表情は 私の森羅万象を
Your expression might rewrite...

46
00:06:53,288 --> 00:06:56,588
書き換えちゃうかも 責任重大ね
all of my universe, you have a huge responsibility!

47
00:06:56,688 --> 00:06:59,588
一切合切 dance dance dance we are dancing reed
Through it all, dance dance dance, we are dancing reed!

48
00:06:59,688 --> 00:07:03,688
夢中になって絡み合った ゼログラビティ
Entangled in a trance, zero gravity!

49
00:07:03,788 --> 00:07:07,688
構わず dance dance dance just a dance just a dance
Without a care, dance dance dance, just a dance, just a dance!

50
00:07:07,788 --> 00:07:11,188
声は闇に預けたまま
Leaving our voices behind in the darkness,

51
00:07:11,288 --> 00:07:15,188
目を覚ましても離れないで
even if you wake up, don't let go of me.

52
00:07:21,888 --> 00:07:25,288
maybe needy 正気じゃないのよ
Maybe needy, I'm out of my mind.

53
00:07:25,388 --> 00:07:28,888
体温が忘れられない
I can't forget your warmth.

54
00:07:28,988 --> 00:07:32,788
誰彼そんなんじゃないから
It's not just with anyone, so...

55
00:07:32,888 --> 00:07:36,188
独り占めして euphoria
keep me all to yourself, euphoria!

56
00:07:36,288 --> 00:07:39,888
気にしてない様な言葉は装飾で
Words pretending not to care are just decoration,

57
00:07:39,988 --> 00:07:43,888
メイクの様には流せない
they can't be washed away like makeup.

58
00:07:43,988 --> 00:07:49,888
360°偽りだって 隠し切れぬような
Even if it's 360° of deceit, it can't be completely hidden...

59
00:07:49,988 --> 00:07:53,888
私に構って 嬉しいなんて crazy crazy love
Thrilled that you're paying attention to me, crazy, crazy love!

60
00:07:53,988 --> 00:07:57,388
摩天楼から連れさらって
Sweep me away from the skyscrapers!

61
00:07:57,488 --> 00:08:01,488
君の表情は 私の深層心理を
Your expression might substitute...

62
00:08:01,588 --> 00:08:04,888
すり替えちゃうのよ 責任重大ね
my deep subconscious, you have a huge responsibility!

63
00:08:04,988 --> 00:08:09,388
過ぎ去ったネオン 残像 shooting star
Passing neons, an afterimage of a shooting star!

64
00:08:20,988 --> 00:08:27,788
グライダーみたいに漂えば 幸も不幸もなかった
Drifting like a glider, there was neither fortune nor sorrow.

65
00:08:27,888 --> 00:08:31,888
指先でまた君を探している
Reaching out with my fingertips, searching for you again...

66
00:08:31,988 --> 00:08:35,088
その声を聴かせてよ
let me hear your voice!

67
00:08:35,188 --> 00:08:39,088
私に構って 教えてよ恋の先を！
Pay attention to me, tell me what lies beyond love!

68
00:08:39,188 --> 00:08:42,588
拡がって収まんない universe
An expanding, boundless universe!

69
00:08:42,688 --> 00:08:46,488
君の存在は 私の将来までも
Your existence stepped into my future as well,

70
00:08:46,588 --> 00:08:49,988
踏み込んだのよ 付き合ってよね
so stay with me, okay?

71
00:08:50,088 --> 00:08:52,888
一切合切 dance dance dance we are dancing reed
Through it all, dance dance dance, we are dancing reed!

72
00:08:52,988 --> 00:08:56,988
夢中になって絡み合った ゼログラビティ
Entangled in a trance, zero gravity!

73
00:08:57,088 --> 00:09:01,088
構わず dance dance dance just a dance just a dance
Without a care, dance dance dance, just a dance, just a dance!

74
00:09:01,188 --> 00:09:04,588
声は闇に預けたまま
Leaving our voices behind in the darkness,

75
00:09:04,688 --> 00:09:08,588
目を覚ましても離れないで
even if you wake up, don't let go of me.

76
00:09:25,088 --> 00:09:27,188
みんなー！
Everyone!

77
00:09:27,188 --> 00:09:32,688
今日はお誕生日ライブに来てくれて ありがとー！
Thank you so much for coming to my birthday live stream!

78
00:09:33,288 --> 00:09:35,888
コメントも見えてるよー！
I can see your comments too!

79
00:09:36,188 --> 00:09:40,088
最初に聴いてもらったのが『Diva』、『Dancing Reed』でしたー！
The first songs you heard were "Diva" and "Dancing Reed"!

80
00:09:40,488 --> 00:09:44,688
えー、この2つの曲は、あのー、フェスと、
Um, these two songs, well, from the fes,

81
00:09:44,688 --> 00:09:49,088
あと去年のね、ドラマの主題歌に使わせて…使っていただいた曲で、
and as the theme song for last year's drama that I had the privilege to use... that was used for,

82
00:09:49,188 --> 00:09:54,788
すごく思い出に残っているので、最初に2曲歌ってみようかなーと思って選びましたー！
they hold so many memories for me, so I chose them thinking I'd sing these two first!

83
00:09:55,088 --> 00:09:57,388
そして、今回はですね、
And for this time,

84
00:09:57,388 --> 00:10:00,988
ときのそら お披露目誕生日…えー、2026…
Tokino Sora Debut Birthday... um, 2026...

85
00:10:00,988 --> 00:10:03,688
ときのそらおじゃないよ？ ときのそらだよ？
It's not Tokinosorao, okay? It's Tokino Sora!

86
00:10:04,429 --> 00:10:08,129
えー、みんなのつぶやきを待ってるので、たくさんつぶやいてほしいな！
I'm waiting for everyone's tweets, so please tweet a lot!

87
00:10:08,129 --> 00:10:11,129
トレンドに入るといいな！
It'd be great if we trended!

88
00:10:11,129 --> 00:10:13,629
ねえ〜？
Right?

89
00:10:13,629 --> 00:10:18,329
そして、今回のテーマは8周年を象徴する「無限」をモチーフに、
And the theme this time is based on "infinity," symbolizing my 8th anniversary,

90
00:10:18,329 --> 00:10:23,529
宇宙や星をステージに散りばめて、中毒性のあるビート、
scattering space and stars across the stage, with addictive beats

91
00:10:23,529 --> 00:10:27,629
リズムの曲で絡めた、えー、「デジタルパルスライブ」です！
and rhythmic songs intertwined—it's a "Digital Pulse Live"!

92
00:10:27,829 --> 00:10:30,629
デジタルパルスライブです！
It's a Digital Pulse Live!

93
00:10:30,629 --> 00:10:35,129
こちらね、大きな天球が曲によってどう変わるのかを見ていてください。
Please watch how this big celestial sphere here changes with each song.

94
00:10:35,129 --> 00:10:38,929
そしてね、今年のぬんぬんは、えー、5つなので、
And also, this year there are five Nun-nuns,

95
00:10:38,929 --> 00:10:42,329
ぐるぐる回転してます。ぐるぐるぐるぐるぐるぐるぐるぐる。
so they're spinning around and around. Round and round and round...

96
00:10:42,529 --> 00:10:45,929
そして、よ- 空には、そらザウルスもいるよ。
And up in the sky, Sorasaurus is here too!

97
00:10:45,929 --> 00:10:50,629
そらザウルスはね、なんとね、炎を出せるようになりました。
Sorasaurus can now actually breathe fire!

98
00:10:50,929 --> 00:10:52,629
ぼー！
Whoosh!

99
00:10:52,929 --> 00:10:58,129
あん肝もね、ちゃんとあん肝座もあるんですけど、見えるかな？
And as for Ankimo, there's an Ankimo constellation too. Can you see it?

100
00:10:59,829 --> 00:11:04,129
もちろん、あと今年も新衣装のお披露目や告知したゲストと、
Of course, along with this year's new outfit reveals and announced guests,

101
00:11:04,129 --> 00:11:08,129
えー、あとどんな曲を披露するのかを楽しみに待っててくださいね！
please look forward to what songs we'll be performing!

102
00:11:08,229 --> 00:11:11,629
そして！次に行く前に、
And! Before moving on to the next part,

103
00:11:11,629 --> 00:11:14,129
プチお披露目、最初にしちゃいましょう！
let's do a mini-reveal first!

104
00:11:14,129 --> 00:11:16,829
カメラさん、上を向いてくださーい！
Camera person, please look up!

105
00:11:19,629 --> 00:11:22,929
はーい！というわけで、
Ta-da! So...

106
00:11:22,929 --> 00:11:28,829
新しいクラゲヘア、新髪型お披露目です！
...here's my new jellyfish hairstyle reveal!

107
00:11:28,929 --> 00:11:32,129
それでは早速、ゲストパート行ってみよう！可愛いありがとう！
Now then, let's jump straight to the guest part! Thank you for the "cute"s!

108
00:11:32,129 --> 00:11:34,929
おー、可愛いありがとう！
Oh, thank you for "cute"!

109
00:11:34,929 --> 00:11:37,329
白組さんもいっぱいコメントしてってね！
Siro-gumi, please leave lots of comments too!

110
00:11:37,429 --> 00:11:41,629
最初のゲストは、この人です！
The first guest is... this person!

111
00:12:07,629 --> 00:12:10,629
[GUEST：電脳少女シロ]
[Guest: Dennou Shoujo Siro]

112
00:12:22,929 --> 00:12:26,929
星の降る度に 恋をする度に
Every time a star falls, every time I fall in love,

113
00:12:27,129 --> 00:12:30,629
バイバイ だって 夜はギャラクティカ
Bye-bye, because the night is galactica

114
00:12:35,629 --> 00:12:40,629
[明星ギャラクティカ / 作詞・作曲：ナユタン星人]
[Meisei Galactica / Lyrics & Music: NayutalieN]

115
00:12:42,129 --> 00:12:48,829
今夜は宇宙のアイオライトが いやに眩しいから
Because tonight the iolite of the cosmos is terribly dazzling,

116
00:12:48,829 --> 00:12:52,429
街のネオンから 逃れようか
should we escape from the city neon,

117
00:12:52,429 --> 00:12:55,129
ふたり
just the two of us?

118
00:12:55,129 --> 00:13:01,629
ほどけないくらい揺らぐグラスが 心惑わすから
Because the glass swaying unsteadily bewitches my heart,

119
00:13:01,729 --> 00:13:04,929
あなただけ 今夜だけ
only you, only tonight,

120
00:13:04,929 --> 00:13:10,629
夜に星梯子架ける
we'll cast a ladder of stars into the night

121
00:13:10,929 --> 00:13:17,129
見つめ あなたの表情 照らして 明星ギャラクティカ
Gaze upon and illuminate your expression, morning star galactica

122
00:13:17,129 --> 00:13:23,529
見上げた あなたの瞳が 宇宙が キラキラって光る
Looking up, your eyes—the cosmos—sparkles and shines

123
00:13:23,729 --> 00:13:29,629
近づくほどに 踊って この孤独ごと抱きしめて
The closer we get, dance, and embrace even this loneliness

124
00:13:29,629 --> 00:13:33,929
ふたりの銀河で 手と手が 星と星が
In our galaxy, hand in hand, star to star,

125
00:13:33,929 --> 00:13:37,329
交わって 恋はギャラクティカ
crossing paths, love is galactica

126
00:13:49,129 --> 00:13:52,129
ああ 同じペースで 泳ぎ出すペイヴメント
Ah, swimming out onto the pavement at the same pace

127
00:13:52,129 --> 00:13:55,129
宵と宵で繋ぐ朝へ 一度きりのダンス
Toward the dawn connecting dusk to dusk, a once-in-a-lifetime dance

128
00:13:55,129 --> 00:14:00,629
あなたと私の 灯す星の行方は 何光年先を指した？
Where does the star we light lead, how many light-years ahead did it point?

129
00:14:00,629 --> 00:14:06,929
結ぶオリオンの 愛の星が 真っ赤に燃えるから
Because the love star of Orion we tie together burns bright red,

130
00:14:07,129 --> 00:14:10,129
今夜だけ 踊りましょう
tonight only, let's dance,

131
00:14:10,129 --> 00:14:15,929
夜は天邪鬼だから
because the night is a contrarian

132
00:14:16,129 --> 00:14:22,329
見つめ あなたの表情 隠して 明星ギャラクティカ
Gaze upon and hide your expression, morning star galactica

133
00:14:22,629 --> 00:14:28,929
そのときめいた気持ち踏み散らして 手探りでいいから
Trampling over those fluttering feelings, stumbling in the dark is just fine,

134
00:14:28,929 --> 00:14:34,929
生まれたままの衝動 隠して 明星ギャラクティカ
hide that raw impulse you were born with, morning star galactica

135
00:14:34,929 --> 00:14:41,129
わたしの あなたの 鼓動が ドキドキって疾る
My heartbeat, your heartbeat, racing thump-thump

136
00:14:41,129 --> 00:14:47,129
壊れるほどに 踊るほどに 本当のこと言わないで
To the point of breaking, the more we dance, don't tell me the truth

137
00:14:47,129 --> 00:14:51,429
最後の夜明けは 手と手が 星と星が
At the final dawn, hand in hand, star to star,

138
00:14:51,429 --> 00:14:54,629
ほどけて 君はギャラクティカ
coming undone, you are galactica

139
00:14:57,129 --> 00:15:00,129
いつだって 愛はロマンティカ
Always, love is romantica

140
00:15:03,217 --> 00:15:06,317
パッパッパヤ パッパ パッパ アヤ
Pa-pa-pa-ya, pa-pa, pa-pa, a-ya

141
00:15:06,417 --> 00:15:09,517
